From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Android.bp: let device/huawei/gaokun3 use
 webrtc_audio_processing

The microphone array capture hook in device/huawei/gaokun3/micarray
runs echo cancellation for voice communication streams with AEC3 from
this library, because the audio HAL does not support the pre-processing
effects AudioFlinger adds (addEffect returns -38).
webrtc_audio_processing is available to vendor modules, but its
visibility only lists the frameworks/av pre-processing library,
cuttlefish and //vendor:__subpackages__. Add
//device/huawei/gaokun3:__subpackages__.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [device-specific]
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 3dd5608..ecdc2b5 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -6441,5 +6441,6 @@ cc_library_static {
     },
     visibility: [
         "//vendor:__subpackages__",
+        "//device/huawei/gaokun3:__subpackages__",
     ],
 }
